th></svg>DateTime</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-blue-50 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-blue-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-square-check-big h-4 w-4 text-blue-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 10.656V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12.344\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Checkbox</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-blue-50 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-blue-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-4 w-4 text-blue-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg>Phone</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-blue-50 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-blue-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-4 w-4 text-blue-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>Email</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-blue-50 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-blue-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link2 lucide-link-2 h-4 w-4 text-blue-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 17H7A5 5 0 0 1 7 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 7h2a5 5 0 1 1 0 10h-2\"></path><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg>Url</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-blue-50 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-blue-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link2 lucide-link-2 h-4 w-4 text-blue-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 17H7A5 5 0 0 1 7 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 7h2a5 5 0 1 1 0 10h-2\"></path><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg>Lookup</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-blue-50 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-blue-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-list h-4 w-4 text-blue-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 5h.01\"></path><path d=\"M3 12h.01\"></path><path d=\"M3 19h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 5h13\"></path><path d=\"M8 12h13\"></path><path d=\"M8 19h13\"></path></svg>Picklist</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-blue-50 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-blue-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-paperclip h-4 w-4 text-blue-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 6-8.414 8.586a2 2 0 0 0 2.829 2.829l8.414-8.586a4 4 0 1 0-5.657-5.657l-8.379 8.551a6 6 0 1 0 8.485 8.485l8.379-8.551\"></path></svg>File</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-blue-50 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-200 hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-blue-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-4 w-4 text-blue-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>AutoNumber</div></div><div class=\"mt-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-blue-800 shadow-inner\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles inline-block h-4 w-4 mr-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>External ID is supported for Text fields and powers bulk data loading + lookup resolution.</div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"stack\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 border-y border-blue-50 bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-3xl py-24 relative\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10\"><div class=\"text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600\">Tech Stack</p><h2 class=\"poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">Core technologies used in the project</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mx-auto max-w-3xl\">AuraCRM uses a straightforward TypeScript web stack: Next.js and React for the app, Prisma and PostgreSQL for data, NextAuth for authentication, and a small set of supporting libraries for UI, jobs, validation, and state.</p></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-100/40 transition-all hover:border-blue-100 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-100/50\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50 p-3 text-blue-600 shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-blocks h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 22V7a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H2\"></path><rect x=\"14\" y=\"2\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">Application</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">The main web app runs on the Next.js App Router with React and TypeScript.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">Next.js 16</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">React 19</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">TypeScript</span></div></article><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-100/40 transition-all hover:border-blue-100 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-100/50\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50 p-3 text-blue-600 shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">Data Layer</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Metadata, records, and access data are stored in PostgreSQL and accessed through Prisma.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">Prisma ORM</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">PostgreSQL</span></div></article><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-100/40 transition-all hover:border-blue-100 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-100/50\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50 p-3 text-blue-600 shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">Authentication</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">User sign-in and session handling are built on NextAuth.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">NextAuth</span></div></article><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-100/40 transition-all hover:border-blue-100 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-100/50\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50 p-3 text-blue-600 shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layout-dashboard h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"7\" height=\"9\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"7\" height=\"5\" x=\"14\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"7\" height=\"9\" x=\"14\" y=\"12\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"7\" height=\"5\" x=\"3\" y=\"16\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">UI Layer</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">The interface uses Tailwind for styling and Radix plus shadcn/ui primitives for components.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">Tailwind CSS</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">Radix UI</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">shadcn/ui</span></div></article><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-100/40 transition-all hover:border-blue-100 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-100/50\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50 p-3 text-blue-600 shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">Runtime Support</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">State, validation, and background work use a focused set of supporting libraries.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">TanStack Query</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">Zod</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">Zustand</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">pg-boss</span></div></article><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/60 p-6 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-100/40 transition-all hover:border-blue-100 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-100/50\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50 p-3 text-blue-600 shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">Testing</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Unit and component testing run through the Vitest-based test setup.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 shadow-sm\">Vitest</span></div></article></div></div></section><section id=\"architecture\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 py-24 relative\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10\"><div class=\"text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600\">Architecture Center</p><h2 class=\"poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">System architecture and execution diagrams</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 mx-auto max-w-3xl\">Context, boundaries, data model, authorization flow, lifecycle behavior, and async import processing in one place.</p></div><section class=\"mt-14 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/60 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-xl\"><div class=\"border-b border-white/40 bg-white/40 px-6 py-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-blue-100 bg-white p-2.5 text-blue-600 shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-blue-100 bg-white px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 shadow-sm poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className\">00</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className\">User Types and Access Boundaries</h3></div><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-4xl text-sm text-slate-600 sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">AuraCRM uses two runtime user roles. Both roles are authenticated users inside the same tenant and both are constrained by object permissions and row-level ownership/share logic.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 p-5 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:p-8\"><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white bg-white/50 p-5 shadow-sm transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600 poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className\">Standard User</p><h4 class=\"mt-3 text-base font-bold text-slate-900\">Business-facing app operator</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Works in the standard app surface (`/app/*`) for daily record operations, list views, dashboards, comments, imports, and queue claim flows based on assigned permissions.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white bg-white/50 p-5 shadow-sm transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600 poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className\">Admin User</p><h4 class=\"mt-3 text-base font-bold text-slate-900\">Configuration operator</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Works in the admin surface (`/admin/*`) to manage metadata and policy: apps, objects, fields, permissions, groups, queues, validation, duplicate rules, assignment rules, and sharing rules.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 shadow-sm transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:shadow-md\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600 poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className\">How They Are Similar</p><h4 class=\"mt-3 text-base font-bold text-slate-900\">Same security model</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">Both are tenant-scoped users authenticated through the same session stack. In non-admin record access paths, both still require object grants plus row access (owner, queue, or share) unless global overrides are explicitly granted.</p></article></div></section><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-10\"><section id=\"architecture-system-context\" class=\"group overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/60 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-xl transition-all hover:border-white hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-100\"><div class=\"border-b border-white/40 bg-white/40 px-6 py-5 sm:px-8 transition-colors group-hover:bg-white/60\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-blue-100 bg-white p-2.5 text-blue-600 shadow-sm group-hover:bg-blue-50 group-hover:border-blue-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-blue-100 bg-white px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 shadow-sm poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className\">01</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className\">System Context</h3></div><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-4xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-base\">Public users interact with one web runtime. The app coordinates database, worker, and file storage boundaries.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8 bg-slate-50/50 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-sm\"><div><div class=\"mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:border-indigo-300 hover:text-indigo-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\">Download SVG</button><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:border-indigo-300 hover:text-indigo-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\">Download PNG</button></div><div class=\"h-[260px] animate-pulse rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100\"></div></div></div></section><section id=\"architecture-containers\" class=\"group overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/60 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-xl transition-all hover:border-white hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-100\"><div class=\"border-b border-white/40 bg-white/40 px-6 py-5 sm:px-8 transition-colors group-hover:bg-white/60\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-blue-100 bg-white p-2.5 text-blue-600 shadow-sm group-hover:bg-blue-50 group-hover:border-blue-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-boxes h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5-4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5 5-3\"></path><path d=\"M7 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5-5-3\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M17 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0-2.06 0l-3 1.8Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8 7.26 5.15\"></path><path d=\"m12 8 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V8\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-blue-100 bg-white px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 shadow-sm poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className\">02</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className\">Runtime Containers</h3></div><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-4xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-base\">Two cooperating runtimes share one data store: request-time Next.js and background worker execution.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8 bg-slate-50/50 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-sm\"><div><div class=\"mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:border-indigo-300 hover:text-indigo-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\">Download SVG</button><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:border-indigo-300 hover:text-indigo-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\">Download PNG</button></div><div class=\"h-[260px] animate-pulse rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100\"></div></div></div></section><section id=\"architecture-domain\" class=\"group overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/60 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-xl transition-all hover:border-white hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-100\"><div class=\"border-b border-white/40 bg-white/40 px-6 py-5 sm:px-8 transition-colors group-hover:bg-white/60\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-blue-100 bg-white p-2.5 text-blue-600 shadow-sm group-hover:bg-blue-50 group-hover:border-blue-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-blue-100 bg-white px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 shadow-sm poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className\">03</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className\">Domain Core (Metadata + EAV)</h3></div><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-4xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-base\">Object and field definitions are metadata. Record values are typed rows in FieldData, with dependency indexing and duplicate-rule metadata alongside safe delete checks.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8 bg-slate-50/50 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-sm\"><div><div class=\"mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:border-indigo-300 hover:text-indigo-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\">Download SVG</button><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:border-indigo-300 hover:text-indigo-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\">Download PNG</button></div><div class=\"h-[260px] animate-pulse rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100\"></div></div></div></section><section id=\"architecture-authorization\" class=\"group overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/60 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-xl transition-all hover:border-white hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-100\"><div class=\"border-b border-white/40 bg-white/40 px-6 py-5 sm:px-8 transition-colors group-hover:bg-white/60\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-blue-100 bg-white p-2.5 text-blue-600 shadow-sm group-hover:bg-blue-50 group-hover:border-blue-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-blue-100 bg-white px-2 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 shadow-sm poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className\">04</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl poppins_44a67ff1-module__VktKBG__className\">Record Authorization Decision Flow</h3></div><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-4xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-base\">Object permission gate executes first. Row-level ownership/share checks run only after object grant.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8 bg-slate-50/50 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-sm\"><div><div class=\"mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:border-indigo-300 hover:text-indigo-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\">Download SVG</button><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:border-indigo-300 hover:text-indigo-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\">Download PNG</button></div><div class=\"h-[260px] animate-pulse rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100\"></div></div></div></section><section id=\"architecture-record-lifecycle\" class